{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_f278440a8b12df13-514\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>李家鼎（鼎爺）在節目中示範了一道家常卻充滿大牌檔火候的「沙茶芥蘭炒肉眼邊」。看似簡單的炒牛肉，其實背後有不少實用的烹調竅門！</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_f278440a8b12df13-514\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3ed52c62-f74a-4368-b516-6df0e6bb635a.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20264CeoOZ2ell1791282138.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3ed52c62-f74a-4368-b516-6df0e6bb635a.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><strong>食材</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'>